<title>NORWAY: Norske Skog in part merger with Hedalm.</title>
<headline>Norske Skog in part merger with Hedalm.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian forestry group Norske Skog ASA said on Tuesday it had signed a letter of intent to merge its units for saw mills and board production with KS Hedalm Trelast, an unlisted forestry company.</p>
<p>The units will form a new company under the agreement, Norske Skog said in a statement to the Oslo Bourse.</p>
</text>
